 basement provides excellent potential for future development and finishing. (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$689,900"],["Type","House"],["Bedrooms","4"],["Bathrooms","3"],["Living area","2,310 sq ft"],["Year built","2026"],["Storeys","2"],["Neighbourhood","Hawks Ridge"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T5S0X5"],["MLS® number","E4507227"],["Listed","September 5, 2026"]],"features":[["Heating","Forced air"],["Basement","Unfinished, Full"],["Parking","Attached Garage"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","3.85 m × 5.04 m (12'8\" × 16'6\")"],["Dining room","Main level","2.56 m × 3.78 m (8'5\" × 12'5\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","3.18 m × 4.32 m (10'5\" × 14'2\")"],["Den","Main level","2.97 m × 3.08 m (9'9\" × 10'1\")"],["Primary Bedroom","Upper Level","3.79 m × 4.12 m (12'5\" × 13'6\")"],["Bedroom 2","Upper Level","2.72 m × 3.50 m (8'11\" × 11'6\")"],["Bedroom 3","Upper Level","3.04 m × 3.15 m (10'0\" × 10'4\")"],["Bedroom 4","Upper Level","3.01 m × 3.84 m (9'11\" × 12'7\")"],["Bonus Room","Upper Level","3.21 m × 4.99 m (10'6\" × 16'4\")"],["Laundry room","Upper Level","1.68 m × 3.22 m (5'6\" × 10'7\")"],["Mud room","Main level","1.80 m × 2.67 m (5'11\" × 8'9\")"]],"courtesy":"Josh Cudmore, Exp Realty","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"edmonton","hood_slug":"hawks-ridge","area":"west-edmonton"}